  "description": "Fixed-width and positional flat-file parsing and writing for .NET: the bank-file and mainframe formats that CSV libraries cannot touch. Attribute or fluent schemas, implied decimals as decimal (\"0000012345\" with 2 implied decimals is 123.45), leading and trailing sign conventions, padding, alignment and trim control, DateOnly/DateTime/TimeOnly formats, null sentinels, enums and booleans, multi-record files via a discriminator (NACHA-style header/detail/trailer), lazy and async reading, fail-loud writing that enforces exact field lengths, record number and field name on every error, collect-instead-of-throw error reports, CRLF/LF/CR handling, and newline-free fixed-length record blocks. Span-based, linear-time, cached compiled accessors, invariant culture everywhere, zero external dependencies.",
